        "thread_id": "TH3",
        "thread_goal": "Define exception handling, compliance checks, and sign-off responsibilities.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M31",
            "speaker_id": 98074,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hello team, I've drafted the exception handling guideline for late adjustments as part of T5. The document is A4 in the project folder. Please review.",
            "mentions": [
              5553,
              326471,
              440036,
              75794
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T5",
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M32",
            "speaker_id": 5553,
            "reply_to": "M31",
            "text": "Thanks. The draft says all late adjustments need approval from the Accounting Manager. That seems straightforward.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M33",
            "speaker_id": 326471,
            "reply_to": "M32",
            "text": "A single approval path could create a bottleneck for minor corrections. We should introduce a materiality threshold. For example, adjustments under a certain amount could be approved by the team lead, while only significant ones go to the manager. This would be more efficient and is standard practice.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thinking_face",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M34",
            "speaker_id": 440036,
            "reply_to": "M33",
            "text": "That's a great suggestion. It protects senior time for what matters. How about this for an approval flow: Level 1 (under $1,000) approved by Bookkeeping Team Lead; Level 2 (over $1,000) approved by Accounting Manager. Does that sound reasonable to everyone?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D5"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M35",
            "speaker_id": 98074,
            "reply_to": "M34",
            "text": "Yes, that makes sense. I can add that to the guideline in A4.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M36",
            "speaker_id": 5553,
            "reply_to": "M34",
            "text": "I agree with that flow.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M37",
            "speaker_id": 440036,
            "reply_to": "M36",
            "text": "Okay, D5 is confirmed. @98074 please update A4. On a related note, T7 requires a compliance review of the new process. Have you had a chance to check our new workflow in A1 and the templates against tax and commercial law?",
            "mentions": [
              98074
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4",
              "T7",
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M38",
            "speaker_id": 98074,
            "reply_to": "M37",
            "text": "Yes, I've reviewed them against our internal policies and they look fine.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M39",
            "speaker_id": 326471,
            "reply_to": "M38",
            "text": "Just to be certain, did that review include the recent updates to IFRS 16 regarding lease accounting? Our new reconciliation checklist needs to reflect the new disclosure requirements. It's a common audit focus area.",
            "mentions": [
              98074
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M40",
            "speaker_id": 98074,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "Ah, I didn't specifically check against the IFRS 16 updates. I will need to do another pass on that.",
            "mentions": [
              326471
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M41",
