        "thread_id": "TH4",
        "thread_goal": "Plan and debrief the pilot simulation of the streamlined close process.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M43",
            "speaker_id": 5553,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, I think we're ready to schedule the pilot simulation for T8. How about we block time next Tuesday to run through the new process using the Q2 data?",
            "mentions": [
              440036,
              326471,
              98074,
              75794
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M44",
            "speaker_id": 75794,
            "reply_to": "M43",
            "text": "Do we have to do everything from Q2? That seems like a lot.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M45",
            "speaker_id": 440036,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "Good question. To keep it focused, I suggest we simulate a few key task paths instead of the entire close. My proposal: \n1. Post 3-4 complex journal entries using A8.\n2. Complete 2 key reconciliations from the new checklist A3 (e.g., Bank and Inter-company).\n3. Run one test case through the new exception handling process A4.\nThis covers the major changes. What does everyone think?",
            "mentions": [
              75794
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A8",
              "A3",
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 326471,
            "reply_to": "M45",
            "text": "That's a pragmatic scope. It tests the highest-risk areas without requiring a full-scale dry run. I support this plan. Tuesday works for me.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "heavy_check_mark",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M47",
            "speaker_id": 5553,
            "reply_to": "M45",
            "text": "The scope and date work for me too.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 440036,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "Great. Let's lock in next Tuesday for the pilot with that defined scope. I'll send out a calendar invite.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D7"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M49",
            "speaker_id": 5553,
            "reply_to": "M48",
            "text": "Hi all, we've completed the pilot. Overall it went well, but we found a few issues. The wording on one of the checklist items in A3 was unclear, and we had some trouble with linking large files as supporting evidence in A8. I've started logging these in A6.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3",
              "A8",
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M50",
            "speaker_id": 75794,
            "reply_to": "M49",
            "text": "I also had trouble finding the right checklist.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M51",
            "speaker_id": 440036,
            "reply_to": "M50",
            "text": "Thanks for the feedback, this is exactly why we do a pilot. I've updated the issue log A6. Here are the proposed follow-up actions:\n1. @5553 to rephrase the confusing item in A3.\n2. @98074 to investigate alternative ways to link large files in A8.\n3. I will add a direct link to A3 in the main process doc A1.\nAny other findings?",
            "mentions": [
              5553,
              98074
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6",
              "A3",
              "A8",
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M52",
            "speaker_id": 326471,
            "reply_to": "M51",
            "text": "The handoff from reconciliation completion to management review felt ambiguous. We should add an explicit notification step in the workflow in A1 and the calendar A2 to signal that all reconciliations are ready for review.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1",
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M53",
            "speaker_id": 440036,
            "reply_to": "M52",
            "text": "Excellent point. That closes a potential gap. I'll add that as a fourth action item and take it myself. So, we agree on these four improvements based on the pilot results. This will make the process much smoother.",
            "mentions": [
              326471
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D8"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
